## 3. Placement + content

### [LEC-MOVES] Move Analytics + Lint into the library
- definition: COPY `magma_agg` (Tier-1/2 branch) + `lts_lint` from ComposeIO INTO lts-engine, adapting their imports to sit inside the library as native layers. Preserve their invariants.
- safety: do NOT delete/modify the ComposeIO originals in this pass — ComposeIO must keep working until the architect re-points it to consume the renamed MCP. The removal + re-point is a coordinated follow-on; FLAG it as a dependency.
- lifecycle-position: raised
- part-of: [SPEC:LTS-ENGINE-CONSOLIDATION]

### [LEC-AGENTIC-PROFILES] Author two generic agentic domain profiles
- definition: `domain-profiles/agentic_decisions.lts` (DEC conventions / lifecycle-position / decided-in-session / relationship verbs supersedes|relates-to|depends-on|part-of / importance / re-derive-via) + `domain-profiles/agentic_artifacts.lts` (artifact conventions / content-hash+freshness / enrichment / provenance / ledger relationships) — COMPLETE, GENERIC, well-formed, matching the `external-company-intelligence.lts` exemplar.
- why: these two domains ARE the bootstrap — the decision-graph is an agentic_decisions corpus, the deliverable-ledger an agentic_artifacts corpus. Publishing clean generic PROFILES for them makes lts-engine a real foundation AND lets the engine query+lint the bootstrap corpora against a defined domain ([DEC-INSTANCE-KEYED-HOMES] bootstrap goal).
- constraint: GENERIC only — no real DEC ids, no ComposeIO/Haven/private vocab. The a/b/c bar (sensible/useful/generic). Real content stays private ([LEC-SPLIT]).
- lifecycle-position: raised
- part-of: [SPEC:LTS-ENGINE-CONSOLIDATION]

### [LEC-SPLIT] Public library / private deployment
- definition: the LIBRARY (parser + the 3 layers + GENERIC profiles: external-company-intelligence, software-engineering, agentic_decisions, agentic_artifacts) is PUBLIC. The DEPLOYMENT (real haven/composeio/zb/clinical profiles + corpus-root config) is a PRIVATE overlay in ~/factlattice-deployment, gitignored, never pushed. Nothing private enters the library.
- lifecycle-position: raised
- part-of: [SPEC:LTS-ENGINE-CONSOLIDATION]

